# A real Secret must never be committed.
#
# The negation is not decoration. `secret.yaml` on its own also matches
# examples/secret.yaml -- the template the README's file tree points a reader at -- so
# that file existed on this machine, was written and reviewed, and was never in the
# repository. Nothing noticed for as long as it took someone to clone and look.
secret.yaml
*.secret.yaml
!examples/secret.yaml
